WEBVTT

00:00.640 --> 00:05.640
Xu'er is right to do great things one must have courage in this age of great contention.

00:05.720 --> 00:11.067
Winds and clouds change constantly being timid and dragging one's feet will only lead to passivity.

00:11.160 --> 00:15.480
Sheng'er it's good that you study governance daily but occasionally.

00:15.560 --> 00:17.440
Also learn your second brother's boldness.

00:18.120 --> 00:18.960
Yes.

00:19.040 --> 00:20.760
Your son has learned.

